If the connection fails:

Step 1
Restart the MCP server / VS Code.

Step 2
If the connection still fails, configure the GitLab MCP server in the VS Code user configuration rather than the workspace configuration.

The recommended approach is to save the MCP configuration to the user/global configuration.

