31. Important Configuration Notes
GitLab Hosted Under /gitlab
The GitLab instance is hosted under the subpath:

/gitlab

Therefore, standard OAuth/MCP discovery URLs need special handling.

The external discovery paths are:

/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server
/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource

The NGINX rewrite rules map them to the corresponding GitLab /gitlab paths.

ALB Configuration
The ALB must allow the following:

/.well-known
/.well-known/*

Without these listener rules, external AI clients may not be able to discover the OAuth endpoints correctly.

Rails Configuration
The workaround must be applied to both GitLab Rails servers.

After modifying gitlab.rb, run:

gitlab-ctl reconfigure

on both Rails servers.

